[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 23647.03, "timestamp": "06:34:07", "text": "。擺架子。等等，什麼？不，不，不。沒什麼。別在意。是啊。你好"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 23651.83, "timestamp": "06:34:11", "text": "。哦"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 23654.15, "timestamp": "06:34:14", "text": "，歡迎烏加布加。歡迎來到我的直播間。你好嗎"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 23666.548, "timestamp": "06:34:26", "text": "？是啊。這就是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 23684.948, "timestamp": "06:34:44", "text": "為什麼我不信任那隻到處"}]